#define HELPCMD_STRING "Usage: bdreader [options] [filename]\n\nBDReader - An e-comics reader\n\nGeneric options:\n   -h, --help\t\tShow help\n   -v, --version\tShow version information\n\nArguments:\n   filename\tComics file to open. Supported formats: PDF, CBR, CBZ, CBT, CB7, RAR, ZIP, TAR, 7Z and image folders.\n\nCommand line export:\n   -e, --export\t\tExport comics file as images\n\tUsage: bdreader filename [export_folder] [format:.jpg/.png/.bmp] [panel: y/n] [page preview: y/n]\n\tExample: bdreader -e Comics.pdf ./ExportedComics/ .jpg y n"
